# Module 31: Istio Hands-On Lab Series

## Lab 1: Install Istio

### Objective

Install Istio and verify core components.

### Steps

Install Istio:

```bash
curl -L https://istio.io/downloadIstio | sh -
```

Move into directory:

```bash
cd istio*
```

Install:

```bash
istioctl install
```

Verify:

```bash
kubectl get pods -n istio-system
```

Expected:

```text
istiod
istio-ingressgateway
```

Running.

---

## Lab 2: Enable Automatic Sidecar Injection

Create Namespace:

```bash
kubectl create namespace demo
```

Enable injection:

```bash
kubectl label namespace demo \
istio-injection=enabled
```

Verify:

```bash
kubectl get ns --show-labels
```

Expected:

```text
istio-injection=enabled
```

